  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Browse PSR or PSD3 text changes"
 },
 "description": "Use this to browse which articles changed between the Commission proposal and the Council compromise text of PSR or PSD3; no comparison with a text published in the Official Journal is held. For one article's wording changes use compare_versions. Across those two texts, lists every aligned article with its classification, filterable by status, materiality and article range. The editorial materiality markers travel on every response whatever the filters, because they exist precisely where the mechanical classification does not show what matters \u2014 a re-scoped defined term changes articles whose text did not change at all. Classifications are mechanical, and the response says on what basis.",
